      "content": "Universal Basic Income (UBI) is the only viable solution to the job crisis caused by AI automation because it directly addresses the growing inequality and job displacement. As machines take over more tasks, the traditional job market shrinks, leaving many without work. UBI ensures a safety net for all citizens, providing financial stability and allowing people to pursue education, entrepreneurship, or other meaningful activities without the constant pressure of finding a job. This approach not only promotes economic equality but also fosters innovation and creativity, ultimately benefiting society as a whole.",
